notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-20T17:18:01.013Z","harness:codex",Implement benchmark registration and eval recording with complete graph provenance on pm CLI/SDK 2026.8.20.
  "2026-08-20T17:42:15.177Z","harness:codex","Implemented content-addressed Benchmark and EvalResult types. Benchmark stores task suite, scoring function, pass criteria, score direction, and a sorted contamination set; every contamination relation is a related dependency with source_kind pm-rl:benchmark:contaminated_by. EvalResult stores checkpoint, finite score, pass verdict, source Run, exact Benchmark, Environment identity, complete environment hash, and reward-spec hash; typed discovered_from and verifies edges make provenance graph-readable."
  "2026-08-20T17:53:25.130Z","harness:codex",Pre-review hardening now rejects altered bodies when an existing content-addressed EvalResult is re-recorded and rejects ambiguous extra provenance-tagged graph edges instead of accepting required-edge subsets. Real SDK regression tests cover both refusals.
